Package: persephone3
Type: Package
Title: Object-Oriented Seasonal Adjustment with a Native Engine and the
    JDemetra+ Reference Backend
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
  person("Angelika", "Meraner", email = "angelika.meraner@statistik.gv.at", role = c("aut","cre")),
  person("Alexander", "Kowarik", email = "alexander.kowarik@statistik.gv.at", role = c("ctb")),
  person("Markus", "Fröhlich", email = "markus.foehlich@statistik.gv.at", role = "ctb")
  )
Description: An object-oriented interface to seasonal adjustment. The default
  backend is the native engine provided by 'rkalos', which runs without Java;
  the reference backend built on the 'rjd3' packages ('rjd3x13',
  'rjd3tramoseats') and the Java library 'JDemetra+' remains fully supported
  through explicit selection with 'backend = "rjd3"'. The package focuses on
  batch processing, hierarchical time series and interactive visualizations.
